{"version":1,"content":"<p>健康的飲食不但能有效瘦身減肥，更能遠離身體疾病。</p><p>台灣醫生以身説法，自創獨門的133低醣餐盤，不需刻意禁食及大量運動，便能成功瘦下24公斤，此後體脂率更維持在20%以下，大大減少了患上慢性疾病的風險。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.187367+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.418600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.418600+00:00","content_hash":"5f340f6050deb7859d510198d43cf68ecc03eb38610a654f7b143aab21e386d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}